                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2540/33.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Fox to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-07-13"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 13,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister foreign affairs requests me wire department that Government and people
                    Ecuador well satisfied action President naming arbiter; newspaper comments
                    friendly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fox</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
